<html><head></head><body>Dear {{{GiftTransaction.Donor_Name__c}}},<br /><br />Thank you for your generous gift of stock to {{{Organization.Name}}}.<br /><br />We received {{{GiftTransaction.Number_of_Shares__c}}} shares of {{{GiftTransaction.Stock_Ticker__c}}}, transferred on {{{GiftTransaction.Stock_Transfer_Date__c}}} and sold on {{{GiftTransaction.TransactionDate}}} for {{{GiftTransaction.OriginalAmount}}}.<br /><br />No goods or services were provided in exchange for this contribution.<br /><br />With gratitude,<br /><br />{{{Sender.FirstName}}} {{{Sender.LastName}}}<br />{{{Organization.Name}}}</body></html>